                                'help_text': '🏠 <b>RedConstructor</b>\n'
                                             '\n'
                                             '<b>Commands</b>\n'
                                             '• <code>.rcbm</code> — open the panel\n'
                                             '• <code>.rchp</code> — show help\n'
                                             '• <code>.rcls</code> — list projects\n'
                                             '• <code>.rcpg</code> — purge broken projects\n'
                                             '\n'
                                             '<b>Features</b>\n'
                                             '• multi-project storage in DB\n'
                                             '• module, commands, watchers, loops, configs and languages '
                                             'tabs\n'
                                             '• module metadata: license, developer, version, banner, pic '
                                             'and heroku_min\n'
                                             '• command creation plus editing of docs and bodies\n'
                                             '• no-code command templates for common actions\n'
                                             '• config creation plus editing of default values and '
                                             'validators\n'
                                             '• validator-aware config flow for Choice and MultiChoice\n'
